{"ref":"BDB, מָעוֹז²","hw":"מָעוֹז²","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מָעוֹז</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Judges 6:26\" href=\"/Judges.6.26\">Ju 6:26</a> <strong>place</strong> or means of safety, protection <strong>(</strong>MT sfs. as if from <span dir=\"rtl\">עזז</span>, but prob. erron., cf. Buhl<sup>Lex 13</sup> Ges<sup>§ 85 k</sup><strong>)</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Judges 6:26\" href=\"/Judges.6.26\">Ju 6:26</a> +, cstr. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.2\">Is 30:2</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מָעוּזִי</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:33\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.33\">2 S 22:33</a> (but read <span dir=\"rtl\">הַמְּאַזְּרֵנִי</span> as ‖ <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:33\" href=\"/Psalms.18.33\">ψ 18:33</a>), <span dir=\"rtl\">מָעוּזִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 31:5\" href=\"/Psalms.31.5\">ψ 31:5</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">מָעֻזּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 27:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.27.5\">Is 27:5</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">מָעוּזּוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 52:9\" href=\"/Psalms.52.9\">ψ 52:9</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">מָעֻזֹּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:10\" href=\"/Daniel.11.10\">Dn 11:10</a>, etc. (read proposes <span dir=\"rtl\">מְעוֹזִי</span>, etc.); pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מָעֻזִּים</span> v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:38\" href=\"/Daniel.11.38\">38</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:39\" href=\"/Daniel.11.39\">39</a>, sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מָעֻזְּנֶיהָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 23:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.23.11\">Is 23:11</a>, read <span dir=\"rtl\">מָעֻזֶּיהָ</span> (Ges<sup>§ 20 o</sup> Che<sup>Heb. Hpt.</sup> al.; del. d. f. in all, v. supr.);—<br><strong>1.</strong>  lit. <em>place of safety</em> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:33\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.33\">2 S 22:33</a>, hence (c. collat. idea of <em>strength</em>, as if from <span dir=\"rtl\">עזז</span>) = <em>fastness</em> <a data-ref=\"Judges 6:26\" href=\"/Judges.6.26\">Ju 6:26</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 23:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.23.11\">Is 23:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 23:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.23.14\">14</a> (in v <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 23:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.23.14\">14</a> (Che<sup>Heb. Hpt.</sup> proposes <span dir=\"rtl\">מְחוֹזְכֶם</span> <em>your city</em>), <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 24:25\" href=\"/Ezekiel.24.25\">Ez 24:25</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 30:15\" href=\"/Ezekiel.30.15\">30:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:7\" href=\"/Daniel.11.7\">Dn 11:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:10\" href=\"/Daniel.11.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:19\" href=\"/Daniel.11.19\">19</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">הַמִּקְדָּשׁ הַמּ׳</span> v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:31\" href=\"/Daniel.11.31\">31</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִבְצְרֵי מָעֻזִּים</span> v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:39\" href=\"/Daniel.11.39\">39</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ הַיָּם</span> i.e. <em>harbour</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 23:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.23.4\">Is 23:4</a>, but del. Ol Du Che<sup>Hpt.</sup>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ מֵאוֹיֵב</span> <a data-ref=\"Nahum 3:11\" href=\"/Nahum.3.11\">Na 3:11</a>; cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">עָרֵי מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 17:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.17.9\">Is 17:9</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong> <strong>a.</strong>  fig., of God <span dir=\"rtl\">(י׳)</span> as <em>refuge</em> <a data-ref=\"Nahum 1:7\" href=\"/Nahum.1.7\">Na 1:7</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 27:1\" href=\"/Psalms.27.1\">ψ 27:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 31:5\" href=\"/Psalms.31.5\">31:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 37:39\" href=\"/Psalms.37.39\">37:39</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 52:9\" href=\"/Psalms.52.9\">52:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 25:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.25.4\">Is 25:4</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"Joel 4:16\" href=\"/Joel.4.16\">Jo 4:16</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳ עֻזִּי וּמָעֻזִּי וּמְנוּסִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 16:19\" href=\"/Jeremiah.16.19\">Je 16:19</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ יְשׁוּעוֹת מְשִׁיחוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 28:8\" href=\"/Psalms.28.8\">ψ 28:8</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">עָז־</span>); so <span dir=\"rtl\">צוּר מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 17:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.17.10\">Is 17:10</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 31:3\" href=\"/Psalms.31.3\">ψ 31:3</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֱלֹהֵי מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 43:2\" href=\"/Psalms.43.2\">43:2</a>; also <span dir=\"rtl\">יַחֲזֵק בְּמָעֻוִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 27:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.27.5\">Is 27:5</a> <em>let him lay hold of my refuge</em> (me as refuge); cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶדְוַת י׳ הִיא מָעֻזְּכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 8:10\" href=\"/Nehemiah.8.10\">Ne 8:10</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ לַתֹּם דֶּרֶךְ י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 10:29\" href=\"/Proverbs.10.29\">Pr 10:29</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  of a heathen god, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֱלוֹהַּ מָעֻזִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:38\" href=\"/Daniel.11.38\">Dn 11:38</a> (read <span dir=\"rtl\">מְחֹזִים</span> <em>cities</em> Che <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 23:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.23.1\">Is 23:1</a> <sup>Heb. Hpt.</sup>).<br><strong>3.</strong>  fig. of human <em>protection</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ פַּרְעֹה</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.2\">Is 30:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.3\">3</a> (both ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">צֵל מִצְרַיִם</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶפְרַיִם מ׳ רֹאשִׁי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 60:9\" href=\"/Psalms.60.9\">ψ 60:9</a> = <a data-ref=\"Psalms 108:9\" href=\"/Psalms.108.9\">108:9</a>, i.e. my helmet; also (of angel) <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:1\" href=\"/Daniel.11.1\">Dn 11:1</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲזִיק</span>).","next":"BDB, עֲוִיל","prev":"BDB, עוּז"}